MAIN
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 12
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 A_retFalse
HSTORE TEMP 6 8 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 A_retTrue
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 A_isSpecial
HSTORE TEMP 6 4 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 4
MOVE TEMP 24 17
MOVE TEMP 25 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 TEMP 24 )
PRINT TEMP 25
END
A_retTrue [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 26 1

RETURN TEMP 26
END
A_retFalse [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 27 0

RETURN TEMP 27
END
A_isSpecial [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 28 1
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 1
MOVE TEMP 31 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 30
CJUMP TEMP 31 L0
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
MOVE TEMP 32 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 9 )
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 32
L0  NOOP
L1 MOVE TEMP 33 0
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 34 LE TEMP 3 TEMP 1
CJUMP TEMP 34 L3
MOVE TEMP 35 2
MOVE TEMP 36 LE TEMP 35 TEMP 1
CJUMP TEMP 36 L3
MOVE TEMP 37 1
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 37
L3  NOOP
CJUMP TEMP 12 L2
MOVE TEMP 38 DIV TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 39 0
MOVE TEMP 40 NE TEMP 38 TEMP 39
CJUMP TEMP 40 L4
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 8
MOVE TEMP 41 CALL TEMP 15 ( TEMP 13 )
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 41
L4  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 42 1
MOVE TEMP 43 PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 42
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 43
JUMP L1
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END

